    <h2>How the game uses it right now</h2>

    <p>
        <code>GameAPIs.Initialize()</code> scans the <code>Assets</code>
        directory, creates the block and item registries, constructs a
        ModContext with the game logger and those registries, then
        instantiates and initializes <code>Crafty.MainMod.MainMod</code>.
        This is a built-in initialization path, not external mod discovery.
    </p>

